      "location": "1.3",
      "defect": "citation-inaccurate",
      "evidence": "Step 1.3 says that from |V(J)|>=|V(G)|^tau, [L4] gives |V(J)|^(1/2)>=|V(G)|^(tau/2). But the cited dependency `thm-real-power-laws` states only equality laws: `a^{r+s}=a^ra^s`, `(ab)^r=a^rb^r`, `(a/b)^r=a^r/b^r`, and `(a^r)^s=a^{rs}`. It does not state monotonicity of x -> x^(1/2) on positive reals, which is the extra fact needed for this inequality transfer.",
      "severity": "nonfatal",
