      "defect": "citation-inaccurate",
      "evidence": "Step 1.4 concludes from `hom(G)^2>=|V(G)|^tau` that `hom(G)>=|V(G)|^(tau/2)` and cites [L4]. On disk, `thm-real-power-laws` proves only product/quotient/iterated-power equalities, not the monotonicity needed to pass from an inequality between positive reals to an inequality between their square roots. The cited item is therefore too weak for this step as written.",
      "severity": "nonfatal",
      "observed_sha256": "5346c914f16e5a25058577458c6ab6c95613f650bc305f42f68d74c322ddf828"
