      "evidence": "Step 1.1 uses [L4] to pass from `|B_i|>=|V(G)| t^(-1/tau)` to `|B_i|^tau >= (|V(G)| t^(-1/tau))^tau`. The cited dependency `thm-real-power-laws` states only equality laws for positive real powers and does license the final equality `( |V(G)| t^(-1/tau) )^tau = |V(G)|^tau t^(-1)`, but it does not state monotonicity of x -> x^tau for tau>0, which is the missing justification for the preceding inequality.",
